{"id":"steam-5184560","steam":5184560,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Ragnarok: Yggdrasil","summary":"The first RO mobile game fusing MMO×SLG! Six divine clans vie for supremacy across a god-realm sandbox. Hundred-city sieges. Seasonal warfare. Swap classes without any loss. Fair, balanced progression — no soul-crushing grind, no pay-to-win. Every player turns the tide of battle.","about":"Ragnarok: Yggdrasil — The First MMO×SLG RO Realm War Game! \n\nThe World Tree is withering, its vitality fading. Six divine clans clash without end, and the fate of Midgard rests in your hands. Built on classic RO character and real-time combat, ROY deeply integrates SLG sandbox strategy to unleash an unprecedented divine realm war. \n\n\\ Six divine factions hold their ground across a vast sandbox of 76 cities and 30 passes. Advance from starter zones to resource heartlands to the core — forge alliances, betray rivals, lay siege, ignite 300-player same-screen kingdom battles now! \n\n\\ 13-week seasons with fully refreshed maps and rules every cycle — new and veteran players compete on equal footing. Every campaign you wage reshapes the World Tree's destiny and writes your faction's legend.\n\n \\ Heavy hitters charge the frontline, builders run logistics and production, diplomats maneuver behind the scenes — no matter your skill level, everyone has a role to play and a stake in the outcome. \n\n\\ Class switching without any regression or loss, dual economy of Exchange + Merchant Guild, and power gaps strictly controlled from the ground up. Trade to Win — everyone can truly fight. \\ Hard cel-shading art style been fully upgraded, cuter and more refined characters, yet classic scenes reimagined. Familiar jobs and melodies, a brand-new divine realm adventure! \n\nRally your guild, choose your clan, and fight for your future beneath Yggdrasil.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5184560/df491a1dda2081cdc7527c48548669654edd0472/library_ca